    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d768">

                <pb facs="0791" n="687" sameAs="frus:frus1913/pg687"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 882.42/6</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Liberian Consul General to the Secretary of
                        State.</hi><anchor n="1" xml:id="d768-f1"/>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Liberian Consulate General</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Baltimore</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1911-09-27">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">September 27, 1911</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to request that the
                    inclosed, which are copies of original instructions now in my office, be filed
                    with previous communications sent to the Department, touching the accrued
                    Donovan Fund, now in the possession of the Washington Colonization Society, and
                    for the settlement of which we have asked the State Department to lend us, or to
                    designate, one of its accountants to audit the Society’s accounts, in order that
                    it may be given acquittance.</p>
                <p>I shall be glad to learn if the Department has favorably considered the
                    request.</p>
                <p>I have [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Ernest Lyon</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>



                <xi:include href="d768-a1.xml" xpointer="d768-a1"/>
                <xi:include href="d768-a2.xml" xpointer="d768-a2"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d768-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d768-f1-content">
                <p>Acknowledged Oct. 7, 1911, by the Acting Secretary of State, Mr. Adee, File No.
                    882.42/6.</p>
            </note>
